The MIT licence above covers this MCP server's source code only.

The data it fetches is licensed separately and is not sublicensed here.

- LMArena Elo is used under CC BY 4.0 from the official Hugging Face dataset
  (https://huggingface.co/datasets/lmarena-ai/leaderboard-dataset). Attribute
  LMArena when you republish a score. Each verdict document carries its own
  `licence` field saying so.
- Vendor list prices are quoted from the publishers' own rates. This server
  does not grant a sublicence to those figures.
- Artificial Analysis index scores (intelligence, coding, agentic) never
  leave this server. Their free-tier terms are "Internal use only with
  attribution"; public redistribution needs a commercial licence we do not
  hold. See https://undominated.ai and docs/LICENSING-AND-CLAIMS.md §1.
